[ext_resource type="Texture2D" uid="uid://daullp0fpsdss" path="res://assets/ui/ui_panel.png" id="2"]

; One 32x32 frame, 9-sliced at 6,6,6,6. Corners never scale; edges TILE rather
; than stretch, so with Nearest filtering every pixel stays the same width — a
; stretched edge at a non-integer factor gives uneven pixel runs.
; Button states are the same texture re-tinted, so one file covers all of them.

